{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05614","headline":"仗劒行 · 万齐融","name":"仗劒行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨夜星官动紫微，今年天子用武威。\n登车一呼风雷动，遥震阴山撼巍巍。\n胡骄子，当见旄头蚀应死。\n愿骑单马仗天威，挼取长绳缚虏归。\n仗劒遥叱路傍子，匈奴头血溅君衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"万齐融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05614.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05614","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}